      <h1 id="creating-dns-records-on-gcp" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating DNS records on Google Cloud Platform<a href="#creating-dns-records-on-gcp" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
